  {
   "id": 516228,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Ignoring drag, what is the x-component of the acceleration of a projectile? Why?",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1011022,
     "content_html": "The x-component of the acceleration of a projectile is <span data-math=\"0\">0</span> because acceleration of a projectile is due to gravity, which acts in the y direction."
    },
    {
     "id": 1011023,
     "content_html": "The x component of the acceleration of a projectile is <span data-math=\"g\">g</span> because acceleration of a projectile is due to gravity, which acts in the x direction."
    },
    {
     "id": 1011024,
     "content_html": "The x-component of the acceleration of a projectile is <span data-math=\"0\">0</span> because acceleration of a projectile is due to gravity, which acts in the x direction."
    },
